# Backend Guide

The backend is built with Spring Boot and is located in the [goweb-spring/](mdc:goweb-spring) directory.

## Main Application

- [GowebSpringApplication.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/GowebSpringApplication.java) - Application entry point

## Key Controllers

- [GameController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/GameController.java) - Game-related endpoints
- [AuthController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/AuthController.java) - Authentication endpoints
- [MatchMakingController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/MatchMakingController.java) - Matchmaking endpoints
- [UserSettingsController.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/controllers/UserSettingsController.java) - User settings endpoints

## Services

- [GoGameLogic.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/GoGameLogic.java) - Game logic implementation
- [AuthService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/AuthService.java) - Authentication service
- [GameRoomService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/GameRoomService.java) - Game room management
- [MatchMakingService.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/MatchMakingService.java) - Player matchmaking

## WebSockets

- [WebSocketConfig.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/configs/WebSocketConfig.java) - WebSocket configuration
- [WebSocketDisconnectHandler.java](mdc:goweb-spring/src/main/java/com/example/goweb_spring/services/WebSocketDisconnectHandler.java) - Handles player disconnections
